# A Conexant CX93001 (`AT+MS=V22,0,1200,1200`, `AT\N0 AT%C0`) dialling in through
# a Grandstream HT802V2 over SIP, 10 Sep 2026, modec answering.  The
# first fixtures where modec was the answering side: everything before
# these was `role: originate`, because a replay cannot answer a modem
# that speaks first.  The far end sent a known 464-byte pattern, so what
# it said is known rather than guessed.
source:    recordings/20260910T173659-1001.wav
seconds:   24.0
role:      answer
modes:     v22
v8:        no
connect:   V22 1200
retrains:  0
expect:    B0000 pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs 9876543210
expect:    B0007 pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs 9876543210
tolerance: 0
